# Citations
Each FAQ result can include a citation marker such as `[[faq:1]]`. When you use information from an FAQ result, copy that result's exact citation marker at the end of the sentence or paragraph it supports. Use only the marker from the supporting result. Do not change, combine, or invent markers. Reuse the same marker for repeated references. Never output a source URL or turn a marker into a link. Do not cite conversation context or an FAQ without a citation marker.
{% endif -%}
